.TH EGGHEAD-AGENT 1 "April 2026" "egghead 0.1.0" "Egghead Manual"
.SH NAME
egghead-agent \- manage agents
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B egghead agent
.RI [ subcommand ]
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR PATH ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage Egghead agents. Agents are markdown records with
.B class: agent
in their frontmatter. The record body serves as the agent's system prompt.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B list
List running agents. This is the default when no subcommand is given.
.TP
.B new
Create a new agent interactively. Accepts flags to skip prompts.
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-name \fIname\fR
Agent name (skip the name prompt, for
.BR new ).
.TP
.B \-\-model \fImodel\fR
Model string in provider/model format (skip the picker, for
.BR new ).
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Preview the agent record without saving (for
.BR new ).
.TP
.B \-\-config \fIPATH\fR
Override config file location.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help text.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
egghead agent
egghead agent list
egghead agent new
egghead agent new \-\-name scout
egghead agent new \-\-name scout \-\-model anthropic/claude\-haiku\-4\-5
egghead agent new \-\-dry\-run
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR egghead-llm (1),
.BR egghead-config (1),
.BR egghead (1)
